<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Your affiliate account is ready</title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif; background: #faf9f7; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    .wrapper { max-width: 600px; margin: 40px auto; background: #fff; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.07); }
    .header { background: #3d2b1f; padding: 32px 40px; text-align: center; }
    .header h1 { color: #f5e6d3; margin: 0; font-size: 24px; letter-spacing: 1px; }
    .header p { color: #c8a882; margin: 8px 0 0; font-size: 14px; }
    .body { padding: 40px; color: #3d2b1f; line-height: 1.7; }
    .body h2 { font-size: 20px; margin-top: 0; }
    .highlight-box { background: #f5e6d3; border-left: 4px solid #3d2b1f; border-radius: 4px; padding: 16px 20px; margin: 20px 0; }
    .highlight-box p { margin: 0; font-size: 14px; }
    .highlight-box .code { font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 22px; font-weight: bold; color: #3d2b1f; letter-spacing: 2px; margin: 8px 0 0; display: block; }
    .stat-row { display: table; width: 100%; margin: 20px 0; }
    .stat { display: table-cell; text-align: center; padding: 16px; background: #faf9f7; border-radius: 6px; }
    .stat + .stat { border-left: 1px solid #e8ddd3; }
    .stat .value { font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold; color: #3d2b1f; }
    .stat .label { font-size: 12px; color: #7a5c45; margin-top: 4px; }
    .link-box { background: #faf9f7; border: 1px solid #e8ddd3; border-radius: 6px; padding: 14px 16px; margin: 20px 0; font-size: 13px; word-break: break-all; color: #3d2b1f; font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; }
    .cta { display: inline-block; margin: 24px 0; background: #3d2b1f; color: #f5e6d3 !important; padding: 14px 32px; border-radius: 4px; text-decoration: none; font-size: 15px; }
    .footer { background: #f5e6d3; padding: 20px 40px; text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #7a5c45; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrapper">
    <div class="header">
      <h1>🍁 Daily Daisy</h1>
      <p>Affiliate Program</p>
    </div>
    <div class="body">
      <h2>You're in, {{firstName}}! ✅</h2>
      <p>Welcome to the Daily Daisy affiliate program. Your account is approved and your referral link is ready to share.</p>

      <div class="highlight-box">
        <p>Your referral code</p>
        <span class="code">{{referralCode}}</span>
      </div>

      <div class="stat-row">
        <div class="stat">
          <div class="value">{{commissionRate}}%</div>
          <div class="label">You earn per sale</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat">
          <div class="value">{{buyerDiscountRate}}%</div>
          <div class="label">Buyer discount</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #7a5c45; margin-bottom: 6px;"><strong>Your referral link:</strong></p>
      <div class="link-box">{{referralUrl}}</div>

      <p style="font-size: 14px;">Share this link on social media, your blog, or with friends. When someone clicks it and places an order, you earn {{commissionRate}}% commission — and they get {{buyerDiscountRate}}% off their purchase.</p>

      <a class="cta" href="{{shopUrl}}/affiliate/dashboard">Get your referral link →</a>

      <p>Commissions are confirmed 14 days after the order is delivered and you can request a payout once you hit the minimum threshold.</p>
      <p>Warmly,<br /><strong>The Daily Daisy Team</strong></p>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
      &copy; {{year}} Daily Daisy. All rights reserved.<br />
      You're receiving this email as a Daily Daisy affiliate.
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
